{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1022304-channeling-blasts-with-correspondence","id":1022304,"title":"Channeling Blasts with Correspondence?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-26T06:46:56-08:00","id":1022304,"title":"Channeling Blasts with Correspondence?","content":"So, one of my favorite science things that never was is the Orion Drive, and it's more warlike brother the Casaba Howitzer. Both are essentially a nuke in a can with one end deliberately weakened to create a nuclear shaped charge, used either for propulsion or a giant space laser respectively.<br /> <br /> It occurs to me that one of the problems with this is that the weakness of the materials can cause the channel to burst, and let the explosion out whereever it pleases.<br /> <br /> But what if you used Correspondence 4, to rip chunks out of space, creating a firing chamber and barrel entirely out of touch with the rest of reality. There's nothing there for the explosion to destroy. But there's also nowhere else for the explosion to go except down the barrel, where you've placed a portal corresponding to the barrel of the ACTUAL GUN that you built.<br /> <br /> Admittedly, getting your hands on a nuke is a tad difficult. But.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-26T10:08:29-08:00","id":1022382,"title":"","content":"It is completely feasible. You can do it some other ways, like treating the &quot;nuke in a can&quot; with Matter and Prime to make the can effectively immune to this blast, but Correspondence can be used as you said, or even coupled with Prime and Forces at fewer levels to predefine the shape and reach of the blast itself. Add some Entropy, and you can make a homing nuclear blast that follow a spatial path directly to the defined target.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-26T10:40:16-08:00","id":1022389,"title":"","content":"I also think it feasible.<br /> But don't forget the dangers of working with powers you can not entirely control.<br /> <br /> Funny thing if you want to fire your Howitzer but nothing happens because you are in a warded area...<br /> Most expensive firework that no one noticed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-26T18:46:36-08:00","id":1022575,"title":"","content":"Depending if the adulterated can is a wonder, an ongoing effect, or an instrument, and how the effect is constructed, it can either work anyway, fail completely, or blast out without control.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}